Test data
---------

Client IDs, topics, keys and passwords in the tests and the examples are
made-up demo values. The CMAC vectors in sn2/protect_test.go are those of
RFC 4493.

Interop test peers (interop/, not part of the module's packages)
-----------------------------------------------------------------

The nested test-only module interop/ builds and runs these in Docker on
the tester's machine; none of their code is in this repository:

- Eclipse Paho MQTT-SN embedded-c at e1e1b73 (EPL-2.0 / EDL-1.0): the
  MQTTSNPacket sample clients.
- bisquitt 0.9.1 (github.com/energostack/bisquitt, EPL-2.0): gateway,
  bisquitt-pub and bisquitt-sub.
- Mosquitto 2.0 (EPL-2.0 / EDL-1.0) from Debian and Alpine.
